--------------------------- WELCOME TO VBBS ------------------------------

You have just connected to VBBS in its ASCII terminal mode.  You can
now download files and read the messages in the feedback section.

If you are an Amiga user, then you will want to get the real interface
program for VBBS, this is TERM.  It is a special terminal package that
will give you an windowed, mouse driven interface to the BBS and will
allow you to do many things at once (for example: upload, download, read
messages and talk to other users in the conference at the same time).

For additional help type "help", new commands are being added frequently,
so you might want to do this from time to time to see what's new.

